## Interface: 16001
## Title: Questie Gamepad
## Notes: Makes the "Access Quest Tracker" controller shortcut (LB + RB + D-pad Up) focus the Questie tracker under Blizzard's native gamepad UI. D-pad moves, A focuses a quest or folds a zone, X folds a quest, Y untracks, D-pad Right uses the quest item, B leaves.
## Author: Brian M. Carr
## Version: 1.0.0
## Dependencies: Questie

QuestieGamepad.lua
